{"seq":3,"slug":"english","title":"七年级英语","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"七年级英语-简介\">七年级英语 简介</h1><p>七年级英语是初中英语学习的起步阶段。它承接小学的口语和简单词汇，正式进入&quot;语法成系统、读写成训练&quot;的阶段。本内容覆盖三件事：把基础语法讲清楚（语法基础）、把读懂文章的方法教明白（阅读技能）、把学到的词汇语法用出来（写作与口语）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>七年级各学科 hub 都涉及&quot;读&quot;和&quot;写&quot;，容易混淆。本 hub 专注<strong>英语这门外语本身</strong>的规则与技能，与兄弟 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>找本 hub（七年级英语）</th>\n<th>找兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>英语语法、句型、时态</td>\n<td>✔ 语法基础</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英语篇章的略读/扫读/猜词</td>\n<td>✔ 阅读技能</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英语段落写作、口语交际</td>\n<td>✔ 写作与口语</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文阅读、记叙文/文言文</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><a href=\"../chinese/\">七年级语文</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谋篇布局等通用写作思路</td>\n<td>英语句子层面</td>\n<td>中文谋篇见<a href=\"../chinese/\">七年级语文</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同伴交往、表达分歧的为人之道</td>\n<td>仅英语表达技巧</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ethics-law/\">道德与法治</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用英语读到的科普/地理素材</td>\n<td>仅作阅读语料</td>\n<td>学科知识见<a href=\"../biology/\">生物</a>、<a href=\"../geography/\">地理</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>学科知识去对应学科 hub，本 hub 只负责&quot;用英语来读、写、说&quot;这件事。</strong> 语文与英语在阅读策略（略读、猜词）和写作谋篇上高度相通，建议对照学习；本 hub 各叶子文末的&quot;延伸阅读与跨学科链接&quot;已给出具体对照入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>英语技能有明显的依赖顺序——先有正确的词和句，才谈得上读懂和写出。建议按下面的有序路径推进：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>语法基础</strong>（先）：<a href=\"grammar-foundation/tenses-review\">时态综合复习</a> → <a href=\"grammar-foundation/nouns-pronouns\">名词与代词</a> → <a href=\"grammar-foundation/sentence-structure\">句型结构</a>。这是后两章的地基，务必先打牢。</li>\n<li><strong>阅读技能</strong>（中）：<a href=\"reading-skills/skimming-scanning\">略读与扫读</a> → <a href=\"reading-skills/context-inference\">语境推断</a> → <a href=\"reading-skills/reading-passages\">阅读篇章练习</a>。读篇章会反过来巩固语法语感。</li>\n<li><strong>写作与口语</strong>（后）：<a href=\"writing-speaking/paragraph-composition\">段落写作</a> → <a href=\"writing-speaking/topic-discussion\">话题讨论</a> → <a href=\"writing-speaking/daily-communication\">日常交际用语</a>。输出环节把前两章学到的东西用出来。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分人群建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础薄弱、刚从小学过渡</strong>：严格按 1→2→3 顺序走，语法每课配合练习反复巩固，写作从仿写句子起步。</li>\n<li><strong>语法尚可、想提分</strong>：可先快速过一遍语法基础查漏，把主要精力放在阅读技能（尤其略读扫读与做题流程）。</li>\n<li><strong>应对口语/交际场景</strong>：在打好语法基础后，可直接重点攻写作与口语两章，结合<a href=\"writing-speaking/topic-discussion\">话题讨论</a>的 PREP 结构反复开口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>小学阶段的基础词汇（约 600–800 个常用单词）与字母、音标认读能力。</li>\n<li>能进行简单的英语口语问答（如自我介绍、问好）。</li>\n<li>无需任何语法术语基础——本 hub 从最基本的时态、词类、句型讲起。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>学习方法上，坚持每天接触英语：朗读课文十五分钟模仿语音语调，词汇结合语境反复使用而非死记，语法以理解为先、多做选择填空巩固，写作从仿写开始先保证正确再追求丰富。本内容适合七年级学生课堂同步学习与课后自主复习。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grammar-foundation","title":"语法基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/grammar-foundation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tenses-review","title":"七年级英语 — 时态综合复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/grammar-foundation/tenses-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nouns-pronouns","title":"七年级英语 — 名词与代词","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/grammar-foundation/nouns-pronouns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sentence-structure","title":"七年级英语 — 句型结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/grammar-foundation/sentence-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"reading-skills","title":"阅读技巧","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/reading-skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"skimming-scanning","title":"七年级英语 — 略读与扫读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/reading-skills/skimming-scanning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-inference","title":"七年级英语 — 语境推断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/reading-skills/context-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reading-passages","title":"七年级英语 — 阅读篇章练习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/reading-skills/reading-passages"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"writing-speaking","title":"写作与口语","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/writing-speaking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paragraph-composition","title":"七年级英语 — 段落写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/writing-speaking/paragraph-composition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"topic-discussion","title":"七年级英语 — 话题讨论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/writing-speaking/topic-discussion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"daily-communication","title":"七年级英语 — 日常交际用语","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/english/writing-speaking/daily-communication"}]}]}